OL,3,AMP Carla Lockhart quits DUP in Drumcree
OL,4,Arow
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart has quit the Democratic
OL,7,FUnionist Party (DUP) in a row over its
OL,8,Fresponse to the Drumcree parading
OL,9,Fdispute.
OL,11,FThe MP for Upper Bann had been calling
OL,12,Ffor the party to withdraw Stormont's
OL,13,Fdeputy first minister to force First
OL,14,FMinister Michelle O'Neill from their
OL,15,Fjoint office.
OL,17,FLockhart said she was leaving the DUP
OL,18,Fon a "point of principle" and would
OL,19,Fcontinue in the House of Commons as an
OL,20,Findependent unionist.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
